{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And if you offer, etc.</b> That is, if the time for offering the meal-offering of first fruits, etc., arrives — תַּקְרִיב means an obligation, for the obligation of this commandment is continuous; and in place of mentioning the condition of time it says ״וְאִם״."], :book :leviticus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:52:42.449824405Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}